  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Soteria stopping perpetrators of SEAH from working in the aid sector.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme aims: to support organisations in the aid sector to stop perpetrators of sexual exploitation and abuse and sexual harassment (SEAH) from working in the aid sector via more and better criminal records checks on staff and by strengthening cooperation between Law Enforcement Agencies (LEAs) and aid organisations. Strong vetting of highly mobile aid organisation&#x2019;s staff is required to safeguard beneficiaries and staff against SEAH.</narrative>
  </description>
